Types of text that a data scanner recognizes.

To configure a ``VisionKit/DataScannerViewController``, pass one or more options into its initializer. For example, the following code creates a data scanner that detects textual references to money.

```swift
let recognizedDataTypes:Set<DataScannerViewController.RecognizedDataType> = [
    .text(textContentType: .currency)
]

// Create the data scanner.
let dataScanner = DataScannerViewController(recognizedDataTypes: recognizedDataTypes)
```

